	<Folder>
		<name>Riverflow</name>
		<description>Natural rivers:

-Connects to/ affects powerplant flow
-Small diversions excluded if they do not affect powerplants
-Small/ seasonal tributaries excluded
-Tributries included if:
	-flow has gone through a powerplant
	-tailrace of said powerplant AND tributary 		flow passes through another powerplant</description>
		<Placemark>
